#. <CLT 4>包丁入れ…
#. 包丁は、ひとつ欠けたままだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are knives hung on the wall. One is still\n"
"missing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今回の事件には、関係ないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I don't think it's related to this case.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>包丁入れ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are knives hung on the wall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>包丁は、ひとつ欠けたままだ…
#. 舞園さんが…持ち出したまま…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One is still missing. The one...that Sayaka took...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ショーケースの中に肉が入っている。
#. 国産っぽいな。色とツヤ的に。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's fresh meat in the display case. Based on the\n"
"color and luster, I'd say it's domestic.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>色とりどりの野菜が山積みになっている。
#. パプリカってオシャレっぽいよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are all kinds of colorful vegetables piled up. I\n"
"wonder if there's any paprika around here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>厨房から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the kitchen?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi nhà bếp?\n"
"<CLT>"
